      "message": "The rework need time and currently we are not have enough time for the rework since android14 is coming up, and now we need this vendor hook to complete our GKI functionality on android14. \nWe will take the rework for the next release. \nThanks,\nDavidwang",
      "parentUuid": "cd72c7ae_a16103f3",
